<title>BuildMaster Construction ERP - Complete Practical & Viva Guide</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Calibri, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #1e293b; padding: 30px; }
  h1 { color: #1e3a8a; border-bottom: 3px solid #2563eb; padding-bottom: 8px; font-size: 24pt; }
  h2 { color: #1d4ed8; border-bottom: 1.5px solid #93c5fd; padding-bottom: 5px; font-size: 17pt; margin-top: 25px; }
